#: code:addons/delivery_ups_rest/models/ups_request.py:0
msgid ""
"Detected a problem when validating delivery %(delivery_name)s. Invoicing "
"address of the commercial invoice has been defaulted to %(ship_to_partner)s "
"instead of %(sold_to_partner)s to avoid the following error from UPS: \"The "
"Sold To party's country code must be the same as the Ship To party's country "
"code with the exception of Canada and satellite countries.\""
msgstr ""
"ພົບຂໍ້ຜິດພາດໃນເວລາກວດສອບການຈັດສົ່ງ %(delivery_name)s. ທີ່ຢູ່ອອກໃບແຈ້ງໜີ້ຂອງໃບເກັບເງິນການຄ້າຖືກຕັ້"
"ງເປັນ %(ship_to_partner)s ແທນ %(sold_to_partner)s ເພື່ອຫຼີກລ່ຽງຂໍ້ຜິດພາດຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ຈາກ UPS: "
"\"ລະຫັດປະເທດຂອງຝ່າຍຂາຍໃຫ້ (Sold To) ຕ້ອງເປັນລະຫັດດຽວກັນກັບຝ່າຍຈັດສົ່ງເຖິງ (Ship To) ຍົກເວັ້ນປ"
"ະເທດການາດາ ແລະ ປະເທດບໍລິວານ.\""

