"The address of your company is missing or wrong.\n"
"(Missing field(s) : %s)"
msgstr ""
"ທີ່ຢູ່ຂອງບໍລິສັດທ່ານຂາດຫາຍ ຫຼື ບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ.\n"
